cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Council of Mikes in academic or published work, please cite it as below."
title: "Council of Mikes: A skill library of 15 expert AI personas and an 11-phase pre-submit gate for AI-assisted .NET/C# development"
abstract: >-
  The Council of Mikes is a structured skill library that defines fifteen
  domain-expert AI personas (architecture, implementation, quality, security,
  observability, gatekeeping, etc.) and an eleven-phase Pre-Submit SOP that
  acts as a quality gate before any code change is reported as complete. It
  is designed to be skill-library compatible with GitHub Copilot, Claude
  Code, and Cursor, and pairs with MemoryForge for context engineering.
